  "explanation": {
    "short": "A single r is one quick tap of the tongue (pero). rr — and an r at the start of a word — is rolled. qu is a plain k: quiero is KYEH-ro. b and v sound the same.",
    "more": "The u in qu (and in gue, gui) is not said: que is \"keh\"."
